&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;em&gt;Senior CRM Manager - Transformation &lt;/em&gt;to make CRM Self-Service at HelloFresh a reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our central &lt;em&gt;Growth &lt;/em&gt;function has a clear vision: Enabling our local marketing and product teams to reach our customers directly, via push notifications, in-app messaging and emails. For this to work in an efficient and customer-centric way, the right guardrails, tools and knowledge need to be in place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your first mission is to design, launch and scale our CRM self-service model. You’ll do this hand in hand with our CreativeTech squad (Product and Engineering), who are building the future CRM environment in an AI-native way. You’ll work closely with the squad, and potentially be embedded in it. You’ll be the voice of CRM and of our internal users, helping define what this environment needs to look like so teams can send communications safely and independently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is 0-to-1 work in a highly ambiguous space where no one has been before: no playbook, no rules. AI and LLMs change fast and often, so you’ll think about what we need in the future, even if today’s models aren’t ready yet, and be prepared for when they catch up. The learning curve will be steep, but you’ll climb it on the go, together with the team. Our goal: protect our environment from the agents, and protect the agents from our environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From there, your focus will follow where CRM needs it most. You’ll take on further transformation projects, so this role is for someone who enjoys building something new and then moving on to the next challenge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
