&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone capable of assisting us in the operational planning of recipes at HelloFresh. This is a unique opportunity to learn and gain experience within a fast-growing company that is pioneering the food industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to be a driving force in the growth of a scale-up, then this position is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
